{
  "doc": [
    "KPM measurement lists of an E2 node that registers as an eNB (Global eNB ID), for kpimon-go.",
    "e2mgr 6.0.6 stores no ranFunctions for an eNB, so kpimon cannot read the node's E2SM-KPM RAN Function Description;",
    "these are the lists the ns3-e2-agent eNB advertises in it: cell = report style 1 (action format 1), ue = report",
    "style 3 (action format 3), (measName, measId) in order, from ns3_e2_agent/schema/metric-map.v1.json rows kind enb",
    "(ns3_e2_agent/tests/lint-metric-map.py checks the two stay equal)."
